Waypoint removed=路径点已移除
No active waypoint found=未找到活动路径点
Error: Invalid marker ID=错误：无效的标记 ID
Error: Marker name cannot be empty=错误：标记名称不能为空
Renamed marker from '@1' to '@2'=已将标记从 '@1' 重命名为 '@2'
